<GuideLayout title="Is DMZ Free in MW4?" lang="zh-CN">
  <div slot="definition">
    <p><strong>Last verified:</strong> <time datetime="2026-10-24">2026-10-24</time>（Asia/Shanghai）</p>
    <p>本页回答「MW4 的 DMZ 是否免费 / 是否需另购」类意图；商店与地区促销信息以官方页面为准。</p>
    <p>DMZ 是 MW4 的提取模式之一，随<strong>完整本体（full base game）</strong>提供，不是独立免费 F2P 模式。</p>
    <p>价格、地区 SKU、订阅入池以商店页为准；本页不写死价格。</p>
  </div>
  <ol slot="how-to">
    <li>先看「一句话答案」，再展开 FAQ；每条看 <code>Status</code>。</li>
    <li>发售日 / Steam 店页日期差异见 <a href="/mw4-release/">/mw4-release/</a>、<a href="/mw4-steam/">/mw4-steam/</a>。</li>
    <li>Early Access 历史见 <a href="/early-access-mw4/">/early-access-mw4/</a>。</li>
    <li>回 <a href="/dmz-mw4/">/dmz-mw4/</a>。</li>
  </ol>
  <div slot="body">
    <p><strong>一句话答案：</strong> 否——DMZ 不是独立免费模式；拥有 MW4 完整本体（Digital Standard / Physical 等含 base game 的版本）即可游玩 DMZ。Vault 的 DMZ Deployment Bonus 是额外物品加成，不是入场券。 <code>confirmed</code> · Last verified: 2026-10-24 · Sources: <a href="#source-4">[4]</a><a href="#source-5">[5]</a><a href="#source-6">[6]</a></p>
    <h3>FAQ</h3>
    <details open>
      <summary>DMZ 购买资格与免费游玩 FAQ</summary>
      <div class="table-scroll">
        <table>
          <caption>Is DMZ Free in MW4? — FAQ</caption>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Q</th><th scope="col">A</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Last verified</th><th scope="col">Sources</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Is DMZ free in MW4?</td><td><strong>No.</strong> DMZ is included with the MW4 full base game; it is <strong>not</strong> a standalone free-to-play mode.</td><td>confirmed</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-4">[4]</a><a href="#source-5">[5]</a><a href="#source-6">[6]</a></td></tr>
            <tr><td>Do I need the Vault Edition to play DMZ?</td><td><strong>No.</strong> Digital Standard and Physical editions include the full base game, including DMZ. Vault adds a DMZ Deployment Bonus (extra Active Duty slot + Deployment Kit items): bonus gear, not an entry ticket.</td><td>confirmed</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-4">[4]</a><a href="#source-5">[5]</a></td></tr>
            <tr><td>Was there DMZ Early Access?</td><td><strong>Yes (historical).</strong> Digital preorder/prepurchase editions included DMZ Early Access starting <strong>Tuesday, October 20 (PT)</strong>, before the October 23 worldwide launch. Early Access is now past tense. Details: <a href="/early-access-mw4/">/early-access-mw4/</a>.</td><td>confirmed</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-4">[4]</a><a href="#source-2">[2]</a></td></tr>
            <tr><td>How much does MW4 / DMZ cost?</td><td><strong>Prices vary by platform, region, and promotions.</strong> Check your storefront, such as the <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4435490/Call_of_Duty_Modern_Warfare_4/">Steam store</a>, and the Activision Editions article; this page does not hard-code MSRP.</td><td>confirmed（口径：不写死价）</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-4">[4]</a><a href="#source-10">[10]</a></td></tr>
            <tr><td>Is there a free DMZ weekend / Game Pass / F2P trial for DMZ alone?</td><td><strong>Not confirmed from our primary sources in this window.</strong> Editions / Live / DMZ hub do not state a standalone F2P or free-weekend for DMZ. Treat any such claim as <strong>uncertain</strong> until an official notice appears.</td><td>reported / 不确定</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-4">[4]</a><a href="#source-5">[5]</a><a href="#source-6">[6]</a></td></tr>
            <tr><td>Where do release / Steam dates fit?</td><td>Official worldwide launch: <strong>October 23, 2026</strong>. Steam storefront may show <strong>October 22</strong>—see dual-source notes on <a href="/mw4-release/">/mw4-release/</a> and <a href="/mw4-steam/">/mw4-steam/</a>. No reason for the date difference is asserted here.</td><td>confirmed（链发售 / Steam 页）</td><td>2026-10-24</td><td><a href="#source-4">[4]</a><a href="#source-5">[5]</a><a href="#source-10">[10]</a></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
